type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/tgreed86/gnn-directionality-conservation"
title: "Directionality and Conservation in Graph Neural PDE Solvers: Research Software"
authors:
  - family-names: Reed
    given-names: Trevor G.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4230-6687"
    affiliation: "School of Data Science, University of Virginia"
# Software license; documentation and original reference assets are CC BY 4.0.
# See LICENSE for component scopes. This is not dual licensing of the same files.
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research software for comparing directional information and conservation
  constraints in graph neural PDE solvers. Includes dataset generation,
  model implementations, training and evaluation scripts, and figure/table
  reproduction for heat diffusion, linear advection, inviscid Burgers flow,
  LWR traffic flow, and chemotactic cell migration.
keywords:
  - graph neural networks
  - partial differential equations
  - conservation laws
  - scientific machine learning
  - reproducible research
